OL,3,GNEWSA'An utter disgrace' - reaction as
OL,4,ATranslink off-peak discount ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome public transport users have
OL,7,Fexpressed their disappointment as the
OL,8,Fremoval of an off-peak discount comes
OL,9,Finto effect.
OL,11,FFrom Monday morning, a 25% discount
OL,12,Fended on off-peak return travel on
OL,13,Ftrains, Ulsterbus and Goldliner
OL,14,Fservices.
OL,16,FTranslink, which operates public
OL,17,Ftransport in Northern Ireland, blamed
OL,18,Fthe move - and cuts to some other
OL,19,Fdiscounts - on financial pressures.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
